    {
      "source": "Overrides <a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html#supportsEventType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>SmartApplicationListener.supportsEventType(Class)</code></a> with\ndelegation to <a href=\"#supportsEventType(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType)\"><code>supportsEventType(ResolvableType)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "覆盖<a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html#supportsEventType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>SmartApplicationListener.supportsEventType(Class)</code></a>，并委托给<a href=\"#supportsEventType(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType)\"><code>supportsEventType(ResolvableType)</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "As of Spring Framework 4.2, this interface supersedes the Class-based\n<a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>SmartApplicationListener</code></a> with full handling of generic event types.\nAs of 5.3.5, it formally extends <a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>SmartApplicationListener</code></a>, adapting\n<a href=\"#supportsEventType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>supportsEventType(Class)</code></a> to <a href=\"#supportsEventType(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType)\"><code>supportsEventType(ResolvableType)</code></a>\nwith a default method.",
      "translation": "自 Spring Framework 4.2 起，该接口取代了基于类的<a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>SmartApplicationListener</code></a>，并完整支持泛型事件类型。\n自 5.3.5 起，它正式扩展了<a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.event\"><code>SmartApplicationListener</code></a>，通过默认方法将<a href=\"#supportsEventType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>supportsEventType(Class)</code></a>适配为<a href=\"#supportsEventType(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType)\"><code>supportsEventType(ResolvableType)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>ApplicationListener</code> for the given event type.",
      "translation": "为给定的事件类型创建一个新的<code>ApplicationListener</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine whether this listener actually supports the given event type.",
      "translation": "确定该监听器是否实际支持给定的事件类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html#supportsEventType(java.lang.Class)\">supportsEventType</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.event\">SmartApplicationListener</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html#supportsEventType(java.lang.Class)\">supportsEventType</a></code>` 在接口 `<code><a href=\"SmartApplicationListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context.event\">SmartApplicationListener</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"forEventType(java.lang.Class,java.util.function.Consumer)-type-param-E\"><code>E</code> - the specific <code>ApplicationEvent</code> subclass to listen to</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"forEventType(java.lang.Class,java.util.function.Consumer)-type-param-E\"><code>E</code> - 要监听的具体 <code>ApplicationEvent</code> 子类</span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>eventType</code> - the event type (never <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "<code>eventType</code> - 事件类型（永远不为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 2
